I am an intermediate student, 77% federal board, age 19 from Karachi.

94
00:05:48,110 --> 00:05:54,030
I have lived in different cities of Pakistan, currently living in one of the cities in Punjab.

95
00:05:54,110 --> 00:06:01,720
I have seen your video about voting wisely in the last few days and now it's stuck in my mind that even if we vote wisely,

96
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:05,030
