97
00:06:05,110 --> 00:06:07,110
So I am starting my story.

98
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:14,050
I had decided to go to the army, but then I had a mindset but no effort.

99
00:06:14,130 --> 00:06:19,550
So in 2022, I applied to the Navy to be a part of Pakistan Navy as a commissioned officer.

100
00:06:19,630 --> 00:06:21,573
And then after a few tests,

101
