And, son, it's a big deal if you get 6.5 on this English too because your writing skill is very poor.

117
00:07:31,070 --> 00:07:38,590
And after that I decided to go for a bachelor's degree in any of the English speaking countries without even thinking that it is necessary to be financially strong to go abroad.

118
00:07:38,670 --> 00:07:41,230
Only academically strong people do not get a visa.

119
