My father also had the back of some relatives,

120
00:07:43,802 --> 00:07:49,030
but then comes January when I decided to go to Ireland and I researched every university of Ireland.

121
00:07:49,110 --> 00:07:57,810
And the one which I chose is National College of Ireland for Bachelors in Computing and the one year cost is around €10,000 with a healthy bank statement.

122
00:07:57,890 --> 00:08:13,350
statement of one crore plus and now I'm kind of in a worse situation like we can only do forty four lakhs after selling property and so called gold of my mother and the relatives who were backing us just from the mouth in the past have leaved.

