00:08:13,430 --> 00:08:15,030
It's not leaved, it's left.

124
00:08:15,110 --> 00:08:19,710
If you go to the bank, they say, get a visa, we'll give you a loan, nonsense.

125
00:08:19,790 --> 00:08:22,750
