126
00:08:22,830 --> 00:08:25,630
I'm ninety-nine percent sure we cannot collect that much funds for bank.

127
00:08:25,710 --> 00:08:36,510
For bank statement even just we have to show that much amount but I am trying that last one percent socially because our government just wants lavish life for themselves and ordinary people.

128
00:08:37,390 --> 00:08:38,710
I don't know man, what is written.

129
00:08:39,110 --> 00:08:42,304
