139
00:09:13,194 --> 00:09:18,566
35 lakh rupees or if you want to show the bank statement, 60 lakh rupees.

140
00:09:19,370 --> 00:09:22,130
Why would I do that? Why would anyone do that?

141
00:09:22,210 --> 00:09:24,130
So, it's not like that.

142
