144
00:09:36,210 --> 00:09:39,130
But there is some etiquette for that as well.

145
00:09:39,210 --> 00:09:46,130
For example, you can say that I have spent 4.4 million and I have spent 35 million and I am stuck at 9 million.

146
00:09:46,210 --> 00:09:46,510
This is what you should understand.

147
00:09:46,590 --> 00:09:48,860
that like 35 can be made into 44.

148
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:53,948
One person came and said that I have 5 pairs of 5 pairs,

149
00:09:54,028 --> 00:09:56,700
