151
00:09:58,780 --> 00:10:02,340
So if there is such a big gap, then don't go out.

152
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:06,340
I understand that everyone wants to go out, but when there is no gap, then there is no gap.

153
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:11,700
The day before yesterday, we were making bike trails, so I ended up in Donosul, which is in North Nazimabad.

154
00:10:11,780 --> 00:10:14,170
