159
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:39,780
He was very sad but later, you know, Alhamdulillah, things are sorted.

160
00:10:41,180 --> 00:10:45,300
Many people fail outside the bank and many people succeed here as well.

161
00:10:45,380 --> 00:10:47,300
So there is no 100% guarantee.

162
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:52,300
So this is not the way people do it, that you pay the entire fee.

163
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:55,800
Your relatives will not pay the entire fee, who know you for a lifetime.

164
