The second thing is that your IELTS score is okay, 6.5.

166
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:07,890
Now you are saying that why does the bank ask for a statement, all these things are guaranteed.

167
00:11:07,970 --> 00:11:13,890
You won't be driving an Uber for 22 hours and if you're coming to study, you'll have to study before going.

168
00:11:13,970 --> 00:11:15,890
That's why it's called a guarantee.

169
00:11:15,970 --> 00:11:20,890
Many students go there for the same reason that they just want to earn money.

170
00:11:20,970 --> 00:11:25,632
Many students take the early solution that, yes, okay,

171
00:11:25,712 --> 00:11:32,135
