176
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,880
So you can't make that a lifelong career.

177
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:49,740
So this thing, you have to plan from here and go, what I have to do there,

178
00:11:49,820 --> 00:11:52,380
what is my approach, what is my research.

179
00:11:52,460 --> 00:11:59,380
The SOP you wrote, you have to tell the whole thing in the SOP that why I am doing it or what I am doing.

180
00:11:59,460 --> 00:12:02,700
So first, for example, you have to tell that I am going to study in Australia.

181
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:06,900
So I'm going because it's an English speaking country and the weather is similar to Karachi.

182
00:12:06,980 --> 00:12:09,740
I don't want to study in Canada, Calgary, in minus forty degrees.

183
00:12:09,820 --> 00:12:12,740
Neither do I want to study in Ireland in winter, nor in Scotland.

184
00:12:12,820 --> 00:12:14,440
Australia suits me.

185
