187
00:12:23,820 --> 00:12:27,940
And I personally like sports. I watch cricket and play and all that.

188
00:12:28,020 --> 00:12:30,162
And then you have to specify that I'm in this university.

189
00:12:30,242 --> 00:12:35,202
I'm not taking you to a university because the research programs are good, grants are good, opportunities are good.

190
00:12:35,282 --> 00:12:41,722
Even at one point, my friend was telling me, you have to tell your electives that I'm going to do this and that.

191
00:12:41,802 --> 00:12:44,882
And you have to explain all this and come back.

192
00:12:44,962 --> 00:12:49,482
Now in your SOP you have written your whole story of the past. You have not written anything for the future.

193
00:12:49,562 --> 00:12:52,202
So this immediately rejects, I'm telling you from here.

194
00:12:52,282 --> 00:12:56,780
I have never written an SOP in my life, nor have I ever applied, but I am telling you that it will be rejected.

195
00:12:56,860 --> 00:13:00,200
Because you didn't tell them about the plan.

196
