200
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:23,670
That's why I am going into cyber security because this is the need of the time.

201
00:13:23,750 --> 00:13:25,670
and I will use it in the future.

202
00:13:25,750 --> 00:13:28,670
You have to specify things, you have to explain things.

203
00:13:28,750 --> 00:13:35,670
Now the type of email you wrote to me, if you have this email, how you got good bands in writing, I am very surprised.

204
00:13:35,750 --> 00:13:37,670
But you need to fix that.

205
00:13:37,750 --> 00:13:40,423
Now you are a student, you are nineteen years old,

206
00:13:40,503 --> 00:13:44,535
